# This project uses Vite, so the browser-exposed env var prefix is VITE_ (not REACT_APP_,
# which is a Create React App convention and has no effect here).
#
# Local development: safe to leave this commented out. Connect.jsx already falls back to
# http://localhost:5000/api/contact when VITE_API_URL is unset, which matches the backend's
# default port (see backend/.env.example PORT=5000).
#
# Production: uncomment and point this at your deployed backend's contact endpoint.
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com/api/contact
